WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
You drop a coin in a charity box.

2
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.890
A warm glow follows.

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:10.380
Some thinkers say that glow, or praise,
was the hidden reward all along.

4
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.830
In 1844, Max Stirner went further.

5
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:19.460
Humanity, the State, Morality: he
called them spooks that possess us.

6
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:23.680
So if giving makes you feel
good, was it really for others?

7
00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:27.250
In this mission, you'll
split egoism into two claims:

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.040
what we do, and what we ought to do.

9
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.550
Then you'll meet Stirner's
union of egoists,

10
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.240
and 3 challenges to the whole idea.

11
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:39.970
Your mission: find out whether
every kind act is secretly selfish.
